node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store

# ⚠️ `dist/` is ignored on purpose, and it is the decision `MD-3` had to make.
# A git dependency installs the *repository*, so the build has to happen somewhere: either the
# artefact is committed, or `prepare` builds it on install. `prepare` wins because a committed build
# is a second copy of the source that is correct only while somebody remembers to rebuild it — which
# is the same failure this package exists to end.

# The WiQ page mirror — deliberately not committed. See WIQ.md.
/.wiq/
